## RQ2: Inferring venue occupancy from a non-uniform sample

Digital traces reproduce venue *rank order* far better than absolute levels (rank correlations 0.75–0.84 in Tenkanen et al. 2017). Treat app users as a non-probability sample, correct with post-stratification where covariates allow, and validate against an independent count.

